     "... by copy-and-pasting from excel <div><br></div><div>Use <span style=\"font-size:13px\">      tags$textarea(id=&quot;tr_copyAndPaste&quot;, rows=3, cols=40, &quot;&quot;)</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:13px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:13px\">to setup a text area in your ui</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:13px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:13px\"><div>and<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span>cpdat &lt;- read.table(header=T, text=input$tr_copyAndPaste)</div><div><br></div><div>to read in the data.</div><div><br></div><div>To see an example in action copy-and-paste the columns below into the &#39;Transform tab&#39; textarea at <a href=\"http://vnijs.rady.ucsd.edu:3838/marketing/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://vnijs.rady.ucsd.edu:3838/marketing/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792410072801000&amp;usg=AOvVaw01q6rvhCDvNqTaOtHShZP2\">http://vnijs.rady.ucsd.edu:3838/marketing/</a></div><div><br></div><div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"130\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:130pt\">\n\n <colgroup><col width=\"65\" span=\"2\" style=\"width:65pt\">\n </colgroup><tbody><tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" width=\"65\" style=\"height:15.0pt;width:65pt\">test1</td>\n  <td width=\"65\" style=\"width:65pt\">test2</td>\n </tr>\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" align=\"right\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">1</td>\n  <td align=\"right\">1</td>\n </tr>\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" align=\"right\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">2</td>\n  <td align=\"right\">2</td>\n </tr>\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" align=\"right\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">3</td>\n  <td align=\"right\">3</td>\n </tr>\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" align=\"right\" style=